From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 20:31:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 04/31] Add agent-turn context to checkpoints (schema 4)

Additive migration: nullable agent, session, turn, transcript path, and
transcript size/SHA-256 columns on checkpoints. Checkpoint JSON gains an
additive `agent` object (null for manual/Haven checkpoints) within machine
schema 1, and checkpoint show/list and status print agent context.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TZntz1MeHVb13u53UKzx8U
